// OshodiGreyboxBuilder — M2.1 (Claude's spec: docs/specs/oshodi-greybox.md).
//
// Builds the Oshodi greybox district from docs/specs/oshodi-greybox-layout.json
// (generated by node tools/oshodi/oshodi-layout.js — never hand-edit the JSON,
// never move a thing only in the Unity scene).
//
// Scenes (spec section 2, 7, 8):
//   Assets/Scenes/Districts/District_Oshodi_Core.unity  (the tile, additive)
//   Assets/Scenes/Approach_South.unity                   (Agege Motor Road south)
// Menu: "Naija Streets/Build Oshodi greybox" rebuilds the generated root
//   Oshodi_Generated in the OPEN scene (idempotent; never touches hand-made
//   objects outside that root). "Build All Oshodi Scenes" builds both.
// Prefabs: Assets/Prefabs/World/Greybox/<type>.prefab (one per prop type).
// Materials: Assets/Materials/Greybox/ (one flat URP Lit colour each).
// Tests: Assets/Tests/EditMode/World/OshodiGreyboxTests.cs (4 tests, spec 8.6).
//
// Layers (spec 8.3): Ground 8, Building 9, Prop 10, CameraIgnore 11,
// PlayerBlocker 12, Marker 13. Camera occlusion mask = Ground + Building +
// Prop (large only). Static flags on everything that never moves.
// Colliders: primitives only. Buildings get a box matching the footprint.
// The roundabout island gets a cylinder (browser lesson L-125).
//
// QA evidence (spec 11) goes under qa/M2.1/ (screenshots V1-V6, test output).
// Nothing in M2 is DONE on code review — the scene must load with no errors
// and the screenshots must show section 1 (wide road, median rail, footbridge,
// danfos three deep, curved glass, flyover, market, umbrellas, NEPA wires,
// gutter slabs, posters, hoardings).

